  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e174cfc0003576793be8ac13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在风雪交加的道路上，不甘于沉溺温暖——\r\n我选择了，那冻结一切的强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d55a34a893cab0dbe8dd16e340e2bdf5bd9bfef6c713c74b7d70e1f237684bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4f5ce5f2f4e5111e6b2ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不需要，什么声援……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54c30fd0929730e05619f7e3d05d04033be6aa0ebc953013f8f2495afaebed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1f3f087f60434bc4609b44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了谁，为了什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd30cd477706fd5de8a0a4010d0f016b3426ff9b31c611264871922c4ba1f99c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7e11a11cd123a8676b44f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要，太在意我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c047fd7a0550c32e94b9bee66692f8d774ae4a26bc65e1428c36dcf7e7d8c0d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a392f61e6d12fd5f45e256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你是想要重新考虑\r\n契约吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2fcdf24efe6326807f8acb87ded2aafdd68f28fb2d5ba4792e5f4f6489aec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80488e0a8e0fd6eaa6bdacc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皱纹，灰尘……没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6091fda23a909372ce793e7390b926380caa4697b13b33e3931a10f34b6c64d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cf64dce1c1f3c70b2960235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对设计没有不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ddbf281a4e4c3deaa6c75c365d3b1314231cf436359d0c7221d8e83535363c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd36eb2bdc13170fc4e1c2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要强大就好。我一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05f06e195f58fa0ad00b9685799d204c54b6bd8204f8a4c1adf9e280b32623d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5473728f9dd0537c0c663ac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开学典礼的照片……设施里的人也真是，明明不用挂起来的",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904c6b002177e2d7646c38c0ba4fc2236e7b137f17766e49b58cac3f22b402f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af532417fcebfcbcf080a5d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live，真的有必要吗……不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bc1a33adfe43da1a991331f129b61d7e77ba3c2c8dd2ad8f0ba73f827457fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f19958a2b9f7f8527ed5dbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都要强……将这份觉悟，倾注在这件衣服上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279d8c1d68e0e867afb2b275930715ccb88483835f9043a7b89106115fe4ad36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd87597b51aac91551e16d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿什么都不会改变。我就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725df83cb2959c27bbaf1465debe4d7bc8d5df113f9f9176aa7956bcf201a86a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a191bf3d05cd00081b63ef82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……已经，可以换衣服了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ef1814584d2c1632add1dabfbcb07152b411408472340dd4b65b0b2e9c1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f10aaeaebc2707fcf33b7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流行什么的……我不知道，我只穿自己想穿的",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c4ec56079599a7ce6765eb5e32f51558e15eeee8ab8de6732146d4a3760edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a6a28ea6f9e2ee653c09bb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色很好……因为毫不动摇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "534a7d7b67ff5ac82096b7c9168b2cabcdd41c65c703598bc642626e8083d318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296df1c1085f067a7659cb7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皱纹，灰尘……没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6091fda23a909372ce793e7390b926380caa4697b13b33e3931a10f34b6c64d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bf39438ab333cac9db027c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对设计没有不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ddbf281a4e4c3deaa6c75c365d3b1314231cf436359d0c7221d8e83535363c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da6a3e00713b4ebbee663308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要强大就好。我一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05f06e195f58fa0ad00b9685799d204c54b6bd8204f8a4c1adf9e280b32623d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be90313a080e9ccaee244d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开学典礼的照片……设施里的人也真是，明明不用挂起来的",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904c6b002177e2d7646c38c0ba4fc2236e7b137f17766e49b58cac3f22b402f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6e61c7ddf34e99b5fc6811",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live，真的有必要吗……不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bc1a33adfe43da1a991331f129b61d7e77ba3c2c8dd2ad8f0ba73f827457fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0912a58955843161952830c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都要强……将这份觉悟，倾注在这件衣服上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279d8c1d68e0e867afb2b275930715ccb88483835f9043a7b89106115fe4ad36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd410f34c36c94d27eb693c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿什么都不会改变。我就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725df83cb2959c27bbaf1465debe4d7bc8d5df113f9f9176aa7956bcf201a86a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072594a2244d87c5a74b853f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……已经，可以换衣服了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ef1814584d2c1632add1dabfbcb07152b411408472340dd4b65b0b2e9c1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd2795600b45935072083bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d9533d884f9fa2baab1376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步，我都是在天亮前解决的。\n因为那个时候最安静……\n呼吸也最顺畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34a973bc7f84be8b9d124a7a22308106caab3b688bc26783b64c4e0dd905134b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884e61f30625d94beb57e646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……咖啡，只剩下黑咖啡了\r\n……糟透了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f9d88fcafe9e649081eac08ade7da1344af6cad1b2b8244d8226f0b97a5714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6bc6dcaab13234d981ec386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔同学，又在学生餐厅的\r\n角落里吃饭了……明明那个位置，\r\n我也盯上的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeab14b5ddc0179e326fd288d4f1a8150624f4ee05a79c878283690d96f8215c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0dc3849004b17f4124fc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唉。一到小测验前\r\n慌慌张张的孩子就那么多。急急忙忙地互相\r\n抽查题目……那样真的有效率吗，真是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2896e216e42a7e9e0151d02ce078f48f025afc1d72c4ea30a35be91a84af12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7468e5608c3a4f06494b7c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回宿舍后，得在红梦同学\n开始唠叨前给她才行……\n美容面膜。敷的时候能安静些",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4926ae40b4d784acf009e81191d821d1006f6d149d1a0f3d85d97bcbc17e886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638840bb5b7d3af601283388",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作到这个时候吗。\r\n……请适可而止吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ee183afe7c54729729f09ae9dc117fa987cfd42e9cb8e584a45c79437aa41e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53646cacf385f41ac1f36a23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花开了呢。\r\n气槽前辈种的花。\r\n……每一朵，都很漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e127d3bafb1a277c9a12b7dbdf8cfd80e91a717aca88411b37e660b86a7de9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0722d7ff36684f70b3d2c928",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防晒霜这种东西，为什么总是\r\n这么快就用完了呢……\r\n皮肤，不是都变红了吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ba07f50a232ea3a5e59de742b16ad84261a62a1c2fe9801b6ac26215aea5af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54605c37f38a1804f3b74be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大概，又会一转眼就\r\n变冷了吧。\r\n……平稳的秋天，不过是一瞬之间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdf8a54a71fc4049f43cfb14485ff3a5ecf4622bd1b0290942252ca4ed0bb67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f794fc858023ba28db35d7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "围巾，在学校里\r\n不摘掉还是不太行的……\r\n……脖子，凉飕飕的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c17980198ef02b09fe4c44c7a86ac4110664edce5bfd0e4c96d452f5ce90fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f85aeea643d45b7c23a1be4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天是，情人节呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18f8968d31815f4d24a4261d009ced91b413f492c9c831aa5f157680371a2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a7bd219b33bb2cf3075bb65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红梦同学，……什么爱啊拯救啊的\n真是多管闲事。……只要别在睡前\n为了我祈祷就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4818f069ff816ef36d41cddc855c4ab04e4ab2c369e74a0db7a1a66b4ce71ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e404a8d26fee8d9be027418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不小心答应了……和大鸣大放同学\n的并跑……为什么，她要那么直勾勾\n地盯着我看呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1e5bb3586c9feb03ce2729e5c4ecbac39e419af30eb2c513f289c420812b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29fe75cb1458a67ae7e6cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽前辈……\r\n明明不是那种有空来\r\n管我的人……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa1d969d02c71e36cd361a85ad7fd27d302fcaefa2c2c4bf8ac892c1287cec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:633b99500126612b4a305a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……爱如往昔同学，又一个人\r\n在擦黑板了。\r\n……明明拜托班里的同学就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5baaf599050b5b01cc6bc39242b7c96bf61ee957661da33d538b7eab189ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31424a945476bf732b30b662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新宇宙同学，晚上又在屋顶上\r\n眺望星空什么的……\r\n那样只会，感到寂寞的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b059be97bcbfa6a9c56837e8d9f0ddba7c01ff05454b714d0c632cba85f6673b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9809d66d0c023d8e81ccbb17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选手和粉丝之间的关系……\r\n不过是奔跑者和观赛者而已。\r\n我觉得仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca4e3b56bfb586cab04e5e5c41fd51195581f0305d099727885a38c72af3174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d68422a4679bb6f39720dc65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发声训练也好，舞蹈课也好\n我都是拿出了成绩的。……不管是\n什么事，懈怠都让人感到不快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ee29316ec8e1895597263b4c988c710e2d8226014207f79776ce10d7992d11e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2940a3cf5c3b8544cac21fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……那份无法触及的强大。\r\n我想要表现的，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "561b5a5c2a0f01ee6c7c89901d4bd9ba322215e32405bd61bbe24f8510707a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:741a68938bee1f7bd38ee4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也有羽毛和蕾丝等\r\n精细的部分……但没关系。\r\n我并不讨厌保养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccca324a5bd2f0285b10d8d69dd92ce6d91ae0bf9cc50117fab3fa095cc26276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817cf1075c53e9b3f154e64f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……新的化妆水，很贴合呢。\r\n洗面奶用完也不紧绷……\r\n哼。要不要凑齐一整个系列呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "4981291dbdefdf590def4bd9613a07e1065253f1dd41894dd965490f0443aef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:459d8251b5fc505ab1902c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待会儿得去趟学生会室……\r\n唉。在又被劝诱之前\r\n赶紧离开吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65afb3b302a884b612caa4ccab19674974be4462fb6fd5176c1314d7ac62ceb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1753d64518e4fe91fb60fc22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耳机，这次买的质量不错呢……\n就算睡着了也不会掉……\n嗯，是次不错的购物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd968cb44804526fa6ec8adb61691ad611e144fc8a01f40946c23e0e47f9f544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2b04f030ca5ed9fd7e1e2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到新学期，要提交的\r\n文件就很多呢。\r\n……没有漏掉的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef6aea611f188b957bcd2007305d7b38408a6518ca70a495259dc2c35e597af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:655af53db720657cc3b9196c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这个季节，白天对于狗来说\r\n对我们来说都是折磨。……特别是狗。\r\n散步绝对，应该在傍晚之后去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06def27ab36d6844435877358ba17009c226e7f7a5274ef1e94884f9fade6bfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1527589109339f3d3670c89b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体乳，该选哪种好呢……\r\n清爽型的感觉不够用了，\r\n但高保湿型的又太早了点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ad8cea38ed332a264214a51d7aa9b99580e841c0e19dc9ea502abe91752b6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e00ccbcfd0feef9d1f5ec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖气，开得有点太足了……\r\n没想到自己冰凉的手，还能用来\r\n驱赶睡意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6c9304b6ebe24ab9dc8e1c29922f107f4172ca061523492c18eb2c66fa7b36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5377df702d8735aa6e55c374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。\r\n……为了击败\r\n昨天的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9af17303a92dbf78189a563de8cecdd3ed220ef8237ac2697b5da60deb59dea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3005e91c7bd75801f4163b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……发生什么事了吗？\r\n……难道说，在这正要开始的\r\n时机，出了什么问题……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be726dc0fb9f97392e814ab3a60c5bb2668ce9a5997170a651c6f1739d021976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0893905107a938850d710e2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不能输给\r\n这里的任何人。\r\n因为那才是“我”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38fbeaecd84c44f57a063e79e6ae957d534fe20e69f87d2d40d0b015061599fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101a72809cded20dd8b5f1bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要，静下心来。\r\n变强。如果不变强的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "615840d47da7c36266653ba60810ee4ec1646d05223485601731c925a6e1e632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c9e3ae1ad17e4c0c13972d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是为了让我变强\r\n才在这里的。……没错，仅此而已。\r\n……我很明白……十分清楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c84386e28258fca49615481f6fb5cbe7964ba128a53ce1d9f02761d2cf1bf13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aca2765bff30c96b6873c04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……那个。训练结束后……\r\n想请您，看一下。\r\n训练论的，作业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "089158c62584a67a90f0e9d8d28f9f96521ba11c90d438689924ffbbf562c90f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e760704ef0dd1eb79028e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我该在什么时候……\r\n向你搭话比较好呢？\r\n……能告诉我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afef567bb3d1f83678c8f64674bdafcdbc61ed4584f7dae382bad5065b2d57a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d147c130cf28feb9051486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……气温并不算太高。\r\n没问题的……开始吧……。\r\n呼…………，嘶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb7156440bc18ee6f89463b5e6a2795969277f185e8e2dc8708830830fc48dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:059abe23f601fc36fe83e440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孕育出的事物……确确实实，在这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2255bb4b18acb4b9ccc62e9f8aaea33b34a58145df2a573962554644fdb7564c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375ab07013330688c3de2ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是以前的我听到的话……一定会很吃惊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5df375e60deb2f47d2337b66b8e4409ae92722d65714b2b500971592de88b07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:899fdccf70711f83bfee7e2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变强，我只是想要变强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5122ec2db650345d8115d83587474cbbd1b832c2518b84d98a3fa3da0655b9aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c205e7e11ddd9be5fef70a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有任何欠缺的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aec3d0aeca54580280fecbb86c29c02ff81263083900235452cbd634fa9038a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b060b11ca4cd7edc8a584c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕律动。……有事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "476225c257240f2d46456478a9f55ee09a447071daa70605224a24a186e04fd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0edcb968c97bf95e5d0100f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如冰冻般的强大。\r\n除此之外——全都不需要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d028c1eb000c05b758931ac987d5e4b854f90058362fcde8ea7ca97e70249c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb74d2215ef055f5d4d03114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是帮个忙的话……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2bbfb17c3ea85183f4a70c6bf8c1b2f9bbf6c99e2b718df5c95e2c827cd415d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6362cff26a83dd5f971dfcdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种事……我并不知道……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742a380097fa75a7840378e22239db058ec464c9b13214de5ff647c61b62afd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a29c3ce19bb2efbcdfaccc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就、全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf81a5473ecf642223d0961d5883c883eaf4569349870d162ee5fc2d7a0cbfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ad9aaf6fc01cb766a83b747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您真是位纯粹又真诚的人呢。\r\n呵…真是惹人怜爱",
      "source_fingerprint": "f698e91a0ab447aaa0a9b1f9a82c6b2be5aef2fbdcb8ba6f7eaf01c6930e3f60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98bdd6e064d331cbdcf47ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6e117ae22a1f40ecde0c95d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5004d3c433d1a1a771d52570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若有任何困扰之事，请尽管找我。\r\n“一切”…都请您放心托付给我",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3617715c9ddcb44904dc8732b73cb2f182a60fa9e752ccb67d38b3d7764f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070ef1be87383d827e283cf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用动物来比喻人的性格…\r\n这话題在宿舍里稍微流行起来了呢。\r\n您的话…大概是 企鹅吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "508c7c4dfd65a8eda96838d7d1ac2352d7354dfcabfbeb55f8a8a81a0826837c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca12442da321330420b0503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贺年卡我是一定会寄出去的。\r\n对于关照过我的人们\r\n礼数必须更要周到才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "648ab4cb2033bc33fce62f7d4603aed42d593bc9a252ded31b52aebcf235b0f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553400f77eab4ab8eaf0515e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起喝杯茶吗？您曾说过的\r\n喜欢的点心，我已经备好了\r\n――毕竟是情人节，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c11558d384e145fb2830264c0b24b8b239e8e06cde5465ac08521aabb58157d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c974fb3dbb57c633b15b5a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与您正相称的、且是我珍藏许久的\r\n一家巧克力店，我已经预约好了\r\n能否允许我为您带路呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90476089cd743238acecad855182bccb27686af3f51dc3877de98c5cce1fda10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bdc42e41ca601768389300c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说宿舍每年都会举办七夕活动呢。\r\n大家都会写下各式各样\r\n的愿望…真希望能实现啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f198fcc957fc61737aef5728e101c518f08cc61d8e3dd58484b902e559d2445f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:debc2ed2ddc3d3a7c3408c7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我恶作剧、吗？\r\n…要试试看吗？\r\n请便，我很欢迎哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ce8c1b0b9f42b57b103a614f1243017a850eab49504038da7589ec69f8be2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fa95607e8393040e017dad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "订购的东西已经全都送到\r\n委员会办公室了吗…啊，没什么、\r\n是因为要开圣诞派对了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d02b3b44570699e8e0a1d6ebdaf0395d70a7655b5093cb33cdacc1626390b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db64292c942f64104d45b5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天吗…我说不上很喜欢\r\n不过。――若是您觉得它漂亮的话\r\n那倒也无妨了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48dbd8827bdfd85dc0aaf2446dc3cec4a7c70dd5b6e77b636475aba30d73957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
